{"title":"Arthur Holly Compton Fellowships in the Physical Sciences and Mathematics","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #f5c518; background-color:#fff8dc; padding:10px; margin:10px 0;\">\n<p>🕓 <b>This article may be inaccurate or outdated.</b><br /><br />\nSome or all of its content may no longer be accurate, complete, or aligned with current standards.<br /><br />\nPlease help improve it by updating the page if possible. If this page needs to be deleted, please use the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Template:Delete\" title=\"Template:Delete\">deletion template</a>.<br /><br />\nIf you have checked or updated this page and found the content to be suitable, please remove this notice.<br />\n</p>\n<hr style=\"border:1px solid #f5c518;\" />\n<p><small>\n<b>Note to editors:</b> Before editing, please review: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere/Arthur_Holly_Compton_Fellowships_in_the_Physical_Sciences_and_Mathematics\" title=\"Special:WhatLinksHere/Arthur Holly Compton Fellowships in the Physical Sciences and Mathematics\">What links here</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Talk:Arthur_Holly_Compton_Fellowships_in_the_Physical_Sciences_and_Mathematics&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Talk:Arthur Holly Compton Fellowships in the Physical Sciences and Mathematics (page does not exist)\">Discussion page</a> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Arthur_Holly_Compton_Fellowships_in_the_Physical_Sciences_and_Mathematics&amp;action=history\">Edit history</a>\n</small>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br />\nEach year, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Washington_University_in_St._Louis&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Washington University in St. Louis (page does not exist)\">Washington University in St. Louis</a> offers several full tuition scholarships with stipend to incoming freshmen in the form of the <b>Arthur Holly Compton Fellowships in the Physical Sciences and Mathematics</b> (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://admissions.wustl.edu/admissions/ua.nsf/3rd%20Level%20Pages_Scholarships_scholarship_CAS.htm?OpenPage&amp;charset=iso-8859-1\">scholarship information</a>).\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Arthur_Holly_Compton_Fellowships_in_the_Physical_Sciences_and_Mathematics&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academic_scholarships\" title=\"Academic scholarships\">Academic scholarships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_scholarships\" title=\"Mathematics scholarships\">Mathematics scholarships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Physics_scholarships\" title=\"Physics scholarships\">Physics scholarships</a></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Arthur_Holly_Compton_Fellowships_in_the_Physical_Sciences_and_Mathematics&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018073645\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.029 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 20/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1880/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.211      1 -total\n 64.05%    9.102      1 Template: